<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>net.milmit.LinuxCare</id>
  <name>LinuxCare</name>
  <summary>Safety-first Linux system maintenance</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
  <developer id="net.milmit">
    <name>MilMit</name>
  </developer>
  <url type="homepage">https://milmit.net</url>
  <description>
    <p>LinuxCare analyzes system health, hardware inventory, authenticated SMART/NVMe storage health, network paths and live socket ownership, container storage, package consistency, battery wear, boot performance and reclaimable storage, explains risk before cleanup, protects eligible user-space cleanup with Safety Quarantine, and tracks maintenance activity over time.</p>
    <p>Created and engineered by MilMit with a safety-first unprivileged GUI, local-only health snapshots, user-level systemd automation, GNOME Shell integration, and typed Polkit/D-Bus privilege separation.</p>
  </description>
